Z||000000||Monkeyman||06-14-2000||12:08 PM||||I spent last weekend at Scotts house (87ECOsomething).  Saturday pm was his birthday party.  What a blast!  I got a chance to meet Chadman as well as seeing some old Fiero/forum friends:  WT III, BENGAL4, and Drew (why can't I remember your forum handle?).  I finally got a good look at Scotts super clean '87 coupe.  Scott cooked out on the grille.  Mmmmmmm!  What a deal.  Other than the fact that I drove the Grape Ape which has inoperative A/C, I couldn't have had a better time.  It sure is nice to spend some time just "chillin'" with some good friends.<P>Until the next meeting of the SOAPOIFOG (Southern Ohio and Part Of Indiana Fiero Owners Group)...<P>Dave||||reg||10
Z||000001||ChadMan||06-14-2000||01:11 PM||||Yeah, I had a good time too!  I wish we all lived closer together though.<P>I hope you don't take this the wrong way, Dave, but for some reason I didn't picture the Grape Ape being as nice a car as it turned out to be.  (Maybe because of the low purchase price?)  No wonder you wanted it so badly.  That color-shifting paint is sweet!||||reg||1
Z||000002||Monkeyman||06-14-2000||04:30 PM||||Thanx.  I sure liked your Fierturn, too. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  You'll have to drive yours to the next gathering of the SOAPOIFOG.||||reg||1
Z||000003||87ECO5||06-14-2000||07:21 PM||||87ECOsomething here!  Could someone please provide the pronunciation for our new group!?  Is it so-a-POY-fog!!!???    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Oh man!!!  I can't tell you how great it was to have you all at the house!!!!!  And I can't put into words how much I enjoy hanging out with you guys!  Go figure - we have this awesome ring of friends because of the Fiero!  I cherish the friendship I have with each and every one of you!  Monkeyman, ChadMan, BOILERMAKER, BENGAL4, william_thorniii, fiero56, 2M4 Dale, and Redfiero!  You guys are the absolute greatest!!!!!  I hope we all stay in touch for a long, long, long time!<P>Let's do something like this again real soon, OK?||||reg||14
Z||000004||BENGAL4||06-14-2000||07:32 PM||||Scott & Lisa,<P>Thanks for your hospitality. I had a great time. MM, WTIII, Chadman, 56 it was great seeing you guys again. Although I was Fieroless, it was nice being around them again. 56 gave me a ride in his immaculate 88 Fomula. It looks so good, you would swear it is almost new. MM, the Grape Ape does you proud. Scott, I can tell you have put alot of time into your third love (Lisa and the kids are 1 & 2). WTIII, didn't look at your SE, because by the time I got to it, I had had too many Henies. And finally Chadman, I will see you on the return trip from Toronto. ||||reg||1
