Z||000006||Monkeyman||06-14-2000||08:11 PM||||Scott--I was guessing "Soap-O-I-Fog", but we can discuss that at the next convention. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I still need to meet 2M4Dale and RedFiero.  Maybe they'll show up next time.  (About a month from now would be nice--That way I can pick up my parts from you and WT III <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">)<P>Bill--I hope you're feeling better.  You left about an hour before I returned on Sunday.  Too bad I missed you then.  BTW--Seems to me that Scotts ride  (he and Drew must get together when they detail their cars) would actually be his 4th love <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.  Lisa and <B>2</B> kids.  (Just giving you a rough time! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">)<P>BOILERMAKER,2M4Dale, and Redfiero--Sorry to have missed you guys.  You missed a heck of a bash.  Whose birthday's next???||||reg||1
